{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStruggling with Online Whiteboard Lessons at School?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStill Stuck Using Paper Binders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Like Programming?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG that lets you play just like <strong>&quot;No-Code Programming&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Online Whiteboards&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828790/extras/Animation.gif?t=1750889318\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip <strong>&quot;Modules&quot;</strong> like warriors and mages with swords and staves, then extend <strong>&quot;Nodes&quot;</strong> to monsters like slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the simplicity of drag-and-drop mechanics combined with the <strong>infinite module combinations</strong> that create delightfully complex battle screens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How you use the modules and what variables you define is up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-Demo Descroption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version, only some nodes and items appear compared to the full version, and a simple game mode can be played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In other words, you can enjoy more nodes, items and game modes in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned &amp; Developed by: SurFun</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828790?t=1750889318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828790?t=1750889318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828790/614b58fcda336d4ad11f0994628b9cf95c1641b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750889318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828790/614b58fcda336d4ad11f0994628b9cf95c1641b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750889318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStruggling with Online Whiteboard Lessons at School?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u30fbStill Stuck Using Paper Binders?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then this game is for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Like Programming?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An RPG that lets you play just like <strong>&quot;No-Code Programming&quot;</strong> or <strong>&quot;Online Whiteboards&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828790/extras/Animation.gif?t=1750889318\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>- Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip <strong>&quot;Modules&quot;</strong> like warriors and mages with swords and staves, then extend <strong>&quot;Nodes&quot;</strong> to monsters like slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the simplicity of drag-and-drop mechanics combined with the <strong>infinite module combinations</strong> that create delightfully complex battle screens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How you use the modules and what variables you define is up to you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-Demo Descroption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version, only some nodes and items appear compared to the full version, and a simple game mode can be played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In other words, you can enjoy more nodes, items and game modes in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned &amp; Developed by: SurFun</strong></p>","developers":["SurFun"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3235830","name":"NodeNexus"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828790/83fe221fd823c68b00b31b1e56a704e822050021/header.jpg?t=1750889318","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257158474,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158474/movie480.mp4?t=1750888495","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158474/movie_max.mp4?t=1750888495"},"name":"\u57fa\u672c\u52d5\u753b","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257158474/c9f4e64117095e4b5fc68e166b9e2212bbea638c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750888495","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158474/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750888495","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257158474/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1750888495"}}],"name":"Node Nexus Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Window10/11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["SurFun"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"25 Jun, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828790/7f5df2f6923c40418b5f774c6c4f223a15ebf9b1/ss_7f5df2f6923c40418b5f774c6c4f223a15ebf9b1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750889318","path_thumbnail":"https://shar